-- The six passengers are outfits of random real Roblox players, picked once and saved here
-- (clothes, body parts, accessories, body colors and scales), so they never change even if those
-- players change their avatars. Source accounts are noted for reference only.
--
-- The driver wears the live avatar of DRG1YOUSSIF (the game's creator), loaded from the account;
-- the saved copy below is only used if that load fails.
--
-- Fields are HumanoidDescription properties; colors are hex strings.

local NpcOutfits = {}

NpcOutfits.Passengers = {
